  "title": "Grilled Cornish Game Hens",
  "description": "Grilled Cornish game hens are a nice choice for summertime grilling. A four-hour soak in a piquant marinade adds nice flavor to these juicy, tender birds.",
  "authors": [
    "Suzanne"
  ],
